WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.820 --> 00:00:08.940
So we're in Santa Ana California in Orange County California

00:00:08.940 --> 00:00:10.600
we're meeting Gustavo Arellano

00:00:10.600 --> 00:00:13.380
the great food writer as well as cultural critic.

00:00:13.380 --> 00:00:15.380
We're at Burritos La Palma

00:00:15.380 --> 00:00:18.320
which is a great low end burrito joint.

00:00:18.320 --> 00:00:22.520
And we're doing this partly to celebrate the legacy of Jonathan Gold

00:00:22.520 --> 00:00:25.640
who's one of the classic southern California food writers.

00:00:25.640 --> 00:00:32.240
And what is great about Gold is that he could enjoy food where he found it and as he found it.

00:00:34.100 --> 00:00:38.160
It's not just what's on the plate or in the wrapper

00:00:38.160 --> 00:00:42.660
it's also, you know, the people making it, the air in the restaurant

00:00:42.660 --> 00:00:44.180
everything like that.

00:00:44.180 --> 00:00:46.080
And I think we're in for a real treat here

